5,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"The plan assumes full staffing, but we are thin. I worry about the people who hold it together.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Kenji,,The depot floor never stops. I need to know if the system survives our actual calendar.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Headline prices lie. I am concerned about the costs that arrive after the contract is signed.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Last time, nobody was in charge when things broke. I want to know who owns the mess.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Systems age quietly here. I am looking for signs of work that comes back needing repair.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Kenji, the yard equipment is old. Will the new system talk to it?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Misaki, yes. If it cannot handle the peak season, it is useless to us.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Yumi, ownership is a contract detail. I am checking the invoices to see the real bill.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Toshio, the bill is important, but if it breaks, who answers? That is my fear.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Toshio, I agree. The initial price is a trap. I am looking at the upgrade history.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Misaki,,I will check the administrator retirements. We cannot afford to lose the last people who know this.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I will look at the depot calendar. The peak season is a hard constraint we cannot ignore.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will review the five years of renewal invoices. The recurring lines are where the money goes.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I will check the support ownership during the last outage. I need to see who was blamed.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will look at the data lift in the 2018 pay move. External work often fails here.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
