35,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The data is grim. Two admins retire this year, and the last posting stayed open for eleven months.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Kenji,,The peak season has no freeze window. The last cutover cost us two days of paper dispatch.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Toshio,,Separately licensed pieces climbed yearly. The bundled agreements held their price. The math is clear.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Yumi,,Last winter's outage sat unowned for two days. Four suppliers pointed at each other. That is unacceptable.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The 2018 data lift had mismatched codes for a year. The dispatch tool skipped three upgrades.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Toshio, if the pieces climb yearly, we are bleeding money. I need a stable cost structure.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Yumi, if it is unowned, it is broken. We need a single point of contact for support.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Kenji, the peak season is a killer. Any system that needs a long freeze is out.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Benjamin, the data lift failure confirms my fear. External teams do not understand our rules.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Misaki, the hiring time is a disaster. We cannot rely on finding new experts quickly.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Misaki,,The supervisors dropped the standard steps from the last rollout. Training by visitors does not stick.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Kenji,,The yard devices are a mix of old models. The 2021 trial was ringed with spreadsheets in a month.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Toshio,,"The board minutes show capital requests trimmed, but operating lines passed easily. We are locked in.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Yumi,,The warehouse rules were rewritten twice mid-year. The scope frozen at start never survived a year.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The dispatch tool has run on our racks since 2012. It is aging in place, just like I feared.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Misaki,,We need a vendor who stays. Not one who trains and leaves.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Kenji,,It must work with our old scanners. No fancy new hardware required.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I want the bundled price. No hidden add-ons that creep up every year.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Yumi,,"I want clear ownership. If it breaks, one team answers. No pointing fingers.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I want a system that can be upgraded without stopping the whole world.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
